  "description": "The meme is designed for a broad general public audience, aiming to challenge common perceptions of disability by asserting that people with physical disabilities are not fundamentally different from others. The visual of a joyful person in a wheelchair and the text 'i'm not any different' are intended to be accessible and relatable to non-disabled individuals, encouraging them to reconsider their assumptions about disability.",
